      }
    },
    "Nur nötig, wenn Scoops am Bildschirm arbeiten sollen, während du weg bist." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only needed if you want Scoops to use the screen while you’re away."
